    "updated_at": "2023-05-26T09:56:10Z",
    "body": "We can't change the semantics of `tee()` without breaking existing sites. But as @yonran suggests, we can add an option to base backpressure signalling on the slower branch.\r\n\r\nWhile a more general mechanism is interesting, it's complex, and I wouldn't proceed with it unless there were some compelling use cases.",
